checkboxes were unchecked, the `Tree` still allowed scrolling and displayed scrollbars.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n* `update_scrollbars()` – scrollbars are now shown only when `<flag> && <content_exceeds_viewport>`.\r\n* `_gui_input()` – early-return for wheel and drag scrolling if the respective scroll flag is disabled.\r\n* Also fixed a shadowing issue where the flags were overridden in the scrollbar loop.\r\n\r\n## Before / After\r\n| Before | After |\r\n|--------|-------|\r\n| ![Before-Fix](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b091b3dc-98f3-433a-b023-5681c346abc2) | ![Scroll-Fix](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a0d52e6-6060-427a-95d6-911385602f9c) |\r\n\r\n> *In the \"Before\" version, scrolling still happens even when vertical scrolling is disabled.*  \r\n> *The \"After\" version correctly disables scrolling and hides the scrollbars.*\r\n\r\n_No API changes, no new strings._\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-05-02T19:58:17Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T15:06:37Z","closed_at":"2025-09-24T15:06:25Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"de645e3c1bf147620612d6e8774a3125316e8fef","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"hayesbp1:fix-tree-scroll-105967","ref":"fix-tree-scroll-105967","repo":{